  "remarks": "Senior member of Jemaah Islamiyah (QDe.092) directly involved in obtaining funding for terrorist attacks. Sentenced in Indonesia to five years in prison on 29 Jun. 2010. Father’s name is Mohamad Iqbal Abdurrahman (QDi.086). INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice:  https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals.",
